1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
One wrong stroke ruins the entire scroll.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,200
I'm your China Travel Expert.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,000
Xuan paper drinks the ink on contact.

4
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
You can't touch up a line — ever.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Any fix dries darker than the first stroke.

6
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,000
So every stroke is one unbroken breath.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,600
Double-tap if your hand would shake.

8
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:22,000
★ Expert Tip: Try a beginner brush class in China.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
One breath, one stroke — could you? Comment.
